    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle of Legendary Tanks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into the spirit World War II and plunge into realistic 3D tank online battles in the game Grand Tanks! Brave tankers, get ready for an interesting game where strategy and the power of combat vehicles decide everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/16ae9c7e51a45e5a32a2530055dd7a1a.poster.avif?t=1749456146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/16ae9c7e51a45e5a32a2530055dd7a1a.webm?t=1749456146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/16ae9c7e51a45e5a32a2530055dd7a1a.mp4?t=1749456146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combination of genres</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tanks is not just a tank game, it is a combination of such popular genres as action, shooter, arcade and strategy. Show your strategic abilities in exciting online battles where every shot can be decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 25+ legendary tanks, where each tank is a story, each shell is a step towards victory. Upgrade your tanks, test different strategies and dominate in PvP mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/64f5b110a79af68f795e6afdb036df40.poster.avif?t=1749456146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/64f5b110a79af68f795e6afdb036df40.webm?t=1749456146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/64f5b110a79af68f795e6afdb036df40.mp4?t=1749456146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a participant in the story  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tanks was created for those who appreciate history, who want to become part of the World War II and who like free tank games. With each online battle, you write your page in the history of the great war, and powerful equipment is at your disposal. Use strategy to defeat your opponent faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Immersion in the Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnificent 3D graphics and impressive sound effects take you to the center of the battle, where explosions and gunshots are felt with incredible realism, this free game offers you to become its hero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/0ff7587b71939d9aa376215317d2f291.poster.avif?t=1749456146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/0ff7587b71939d9aa376215317d2f291.webm?t=1749456146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391400/extras/0ff7587b71939d9aa376215317d2f291.mp4?t=1749456146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, Win and Become a Legend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tanks are waiting for the commander to destroy the enemy on the battlefield. In the online battle mode, the battles become even more extensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Team Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tanks is a team game where your every move is of great importance. Create your own unique tank, participate in rating battles and strategic battles, show your military skills on the fields of the great Second World War.</p>",
